parameters.description:
Jump to a specific point in time: Unix milliseconds. Returns the page of
events at or before this timestamp. Mutually exclusive with `cursor`;
supplying both is a 400.

get.summary:
Report backfill status: the disk-space valve state (live free space, whether
paused) plus per-account backfill progress; per-account sync-service status;
and the running build's identity.

SetRoomNameRequest.description:
Request body for setting a room's name (`PUT …/rooms/{room_id}/name`;
ADR 0068 M19d). An empty `name` clears it — the SDK has no separate
"remove" primitive for name/topic (unlike avatar).

SetRoomTopicRequest.description:
Request body for setting a room's topic (`PUT …/rooms/{room_id}/topic`;
ADR 0068 M19d). An empty `topic` clears it, same convention as
[`SetRoomNameRequest`].
